msgctxt "244"
msgid "Oh god, oh god, oh god... I'm so sorry..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Where's Takuya? He'd better be okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "Hm? What's this dog doing here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "Takuya! Oh, my poor widdle baybee! Mommy's gonna make it all better!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "Takuya's a dog!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Don't call him that! He's a very important part of my family!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Were you scared, my precious angel? Oh, don't be afwaid. Mommy's here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "I'm the one who gave you that rotten mutt, dammit!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"You were over the moon. Went on and on about how much you loved me. I still "
"have the voicemail on my cell!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"You used that voicemail to trick the vet! Of all the low-down, nasty things "
"to do... You're twisted!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"But it worked, didn't it? Everything I did, I did for one last chance to "
"see you again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid ""
"Now that's just creepy. Imagine! Kidnapping for attention...\r\n"
"Pull a stunt like this again and I'm going to the police!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid ""
"I can't thank you enough for all your help, Kiryu-san.\r\n"
"It's not much, but please⑬take this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "You got <Color:8>10,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "Ugh... What should I do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid ""
"I won't tell you how to feel... but if you ask me, you really need a better "
"way to express yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "You got 2,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid "Why won't you tell me where Takuya is?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid ""
"A man came by and took him. I don't know what to tell you, Kurumi-san; he "
"said he was a friend of yours."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid ""
"He even had me listen to a message you'd left on his phone, asking him to "
"pick up Takuya for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid "But I... I did no such thing..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid "Oh... a new message."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid "What does it say?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid ""
"\"We have Takuya. If you want him back, come get him⑬alone. And leave the "
"Kamuro PD out of it.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid "Oh, Takuya... I can't lose you. I don't know what to do..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid "(Sounds like there's been a kidnapping. I should go see if she needs help.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid ""
"Sorry, I couldn't help but overhear. Did you say your child has been "
"kidnapped?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid "Sorry, who are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid ""
"I'm Kiryu, and I run the Morning Glory Orphanage just down the road. If a "
"kid's been abducted... Well, you can understand my concern."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid ""
"Oh, so you're... a teacher? All I know is that Takuya was taken from this "
"hospital."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid "And I just got a ransom note: \"We have Takuya. Come alone...\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid "But it's far too dangerous! We need to alert the authorities."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "736"
msgid ""
"If I call the police, and they hurt my darling Takuya... I'd never be able "
"to live with myself. What on earth should I do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "760"
msgid "Please, Kiryu-san... Can you help me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "772"
msgid ""
"You take care of children every day. Surely you understand what I'm going "
"through!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "784"
msgid "You should call the cops. Let the professionals handle this one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "796"
msgid "But I can't. Don't you see? When I think of what they might do to my baby..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid "The gentleman's right, Kurumi-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "820"
msgid "You really should contact the police. This is one heckuva case, after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid ""
"\"Heckuva case\"...? How can you be so flippant!? If anything happens to my "
"dear Takuya, I just don't know what I'll do..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid "Still haven't called the police, I see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "856"
msgid "I can't! Please, Kiryu-san... Will you help me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "868"
msgid ""
"No, you'd better call the cops and file a report. If you don't move "
"quickly, it might be too late."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "880"
msgid "What can they do...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "892"
msgid ""
"More than a civilian. But the longer you wait, the worse this'll get⑬trust "
"me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "904"
msgid "Okay, I'm on it. Let's go get Takuya back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "916"
msgid "Oh, thank you so much! Be careful, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "988"
msgid "Is this the place?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1000"
msgid ""
"According to the text message, they should be waiting in a vacant parking "
"area just ahead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1012"
msgid "An empty lot, huh? All right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1024"
msgid "We'll have the upper hand if we strike first... I'm going in!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1108"
msgid ""
"Hey! Are you the punk who kidnapped Takuya?\r\n"
"Hand him over⑬now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1120"
msgid ""
"Who the hell are you!? Kurumi's newest flame? Well that's\r\n"
"just perfect, 'cause you're about to get flamed!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1144"
msgid "Best to wait and see on this one. I'll stand guard; you go in alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1156"
msgid "But..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1168"
msgid "Don't worry. If anything happens, I'll be there in a flash."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1180"
msgid "Okay..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1204"
msgid "So it's you... You bastard!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1216"
msgid "Hey! You all right!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1288"
msgid ""
"Hey! Are you the punk who kidnapped Takuya?\r\n"
"Hand him over⑬now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1300"
